# Ordered display strategies. Generated by lrd-adapt gen, narrowed to what exists.
# First variant that produces a live output wins and is remembered.
#  name        renderer  backend   notes
drm-atomic    gles2     drm       atomic modesetting, preferred
drm-legacy    gles2     drm       no atomic, for older msm/mtk
hwc2-egl      gles2     android   vendor hwcomposer + hybris EGL
hwc2-sw       pixman    android   hwcomposer with software render (blob debug)
fbdev         pixman    fbdev     no GPU, proves the kernel only
